			<div class="content" id="post-content-3696002">
									

<p>There’s a minor similarity(I’m not criticizing, I love it) that’s been made here and I’m not sure if it’s on purpose but, when he mentions the Overseers knowing best and leading the Foundation, it heavily mirrors Fallout 3’s Intro GOAT where the final question is like; who is the best at leading us, sheltering us from the horrors of the wastes, and the one true leader of the vault to ensure 101’s survival, and of course the multiple choice answers all state “The Overseer”</p>
<p>Sorry for a small ramble and the poor writing, I’m doing this from a mobile, but would also like to say how much I’ve enjoyed all of these stories!</p>

